    "kind": "scalar",
    "coverageNote": "89/110 provinces have at least one EEA monitoring station within their territory (matched by nearest comune to each station's coordinates). No station-derived value for: AN, AP, AV, BA, BN, BR, BT, BZ, FG, FM, IM, KR, LE, MC, MT, OG, PU, SP, TA, VS, VV — absent, not estimated from a neighbouring province."
